✈️ Airline Ticket Analysis
A comprehensive exploration of an airline ticket dataset to uncover pricing patterns, key predictors, and insights behind airfare variations.

📊 Main Steps

Data cleaning and preprocessing

Handling missing values

Exploratory data analysis (EDA)

Visualizing fare trends and distributions

Feature selection & correlation mapping

Building baseline machine learning models for price prediction

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Pandas · NumPy · Matplotlib · Seaborn · Scikit-learn · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Airline Tickets.ipynb — complete analysis, visualizations, and model implementation
